 "stem": "To graph the function $f:\\mathbb{R}\\to\\mathbb{R}$, $f(x)={=a}x {=bs}$, we find ordered pairs. The pair $({=k}, y)$ lies on the graph. Find $y$.",
 "answer": "m",
 "solution": [
  "$f({=k}) = {=a}\\times {=k} {=bs} = {=m}$",
  "So the ordered pair is $({=k}, {=m})$ and $y={=m}$."
 ],
